<p>While your foes are distracted by your Awesome Toss, you use powerful steam motors to jump into the air and kick a target <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3, 3, 4, 4, 5</acronym> tiles away.</p><p>The impact is so great that it ripples outwards, slowing all creatures in radius 3 by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">14%, 29%, 37%, 43%, 47%</acronym> for 4 turns while the reaction force propels you <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">4, 5, 6, 8, 9</acronym> tiles backwards.</p>